{"item_id": "BM1274", "position": 277, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_13", "anon_id": "M-13-018", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "R <- matrix(c(1,-0.92,-0.88,-0.92,1,0.95,-0.88,0.95,1),3,3)\npc <- (R[1,2]-R[1,3]*R[2,3])/sqrt((1-R[1,3]^2)*(1-R[2,3]^2))\ndetR <- det(R)\nvalue <- c(partial = pc, det = detR)\nanswer <- if (abs(pc) < abs(R[1,2]) - 0.1 && abs(detR) > 1e-8) \"B\" else if (abs(pc) > abs(R[1,2])) \"A\" else if (abs(detR) < 1e-8) \"C\" else \"D\"", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["B"], "note": "The partial correlation (about -0.57) is much weaker than -0.92, and the determinant (about 0.015) is not zero."}
